---
description: >-
  A collapsed flow holding a self-loop, an edge between two of its members and edges across
  its border: the authored `plan --> plan` stays as a loop on the card (v12 keeps it), the
  `plan --> act` that folds into the card is dropped, and the edges in and out end at the card.
---
agentflow-beta TB
  start["Start"]@{ shape: input }
  flow worker["Worker"]
    plan["Plan"]@{ shape: task }
    act["Act"]@{ shape: tool }
    plan --> plan
    plan --> act
  end
  worker@{ view: "collapsed" }
  start --> plan
  act --> done["Done"]@{ shape: refdoc }
